			"parameters": {},
			"seed": 43630.0,
			"size": {
				"x": 1000.0,
				"y": 230.0
			},
			"text": "Sectional door panels for hangar and loading doors: four horizontal insulated steel panels a repeat, three pressed ribs in each, a vertical stile where the repeat ends. Opaque paint (metallic 0), satin roughness 0.42, white so that a door's tint colours it; faint rain streaks, joints shaded in the albedo so they read at board zoom. One repeat covers 12 board units on a door (a panel 3 high). Export Godot/Godot 4 Standard into data/models/board/textures/structures/common, then Reload assets.",
			"title": "About this material",
			"type": "comment"
		},
